{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有著「令和廣告女王」之稱31歲的日本女星川口春奈，7月19日才被日媒爆出，與這屆（2026）世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉低調密戀一年，兩人將準備結婚。沒想到事隔近2周，兩人就發出聲明，宣布已登記結婚，且川口春奈已懷孕，可說是雙喜臨門。</p><p>川口春奈在聲明開頭寫下：「一直以來支持我們的各位。」接著正式宣布：「這次，我們坂倉與川口春奈想向大家報告，我們已經結婚了。」除了升格人妻外，她也驚喜透露：「另外，我的肚子裡也有了我們的寶寶。」證實即將迎來新生命。</p><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈宣布與2026世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉已登記結婚，且已懷孕。（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160895657708359680017834.jpeg/yL_k_sfm1MI2hl1G5aWEp1kQ_PsmrR7DiRrw9oka8PY\"/><figcaption>川口春奈宣布與2026世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉已登記結婚，且已懷孕。（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><p>更多川口春奈、板倉滉照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈與2026世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉發出聲明宣佈已登記結婚，且已懷孕。（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896285880881152841095.jpeg/61-CuRK5o3_atn56h6G5mc1TOkm8Pq9BOy3dPzst3T8\"/><figcaption>川口春奈與2026世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉發出聲明宣佈已登記結婚，且已懷孕。（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896293053140992975186.jpeg/F2GXje7gakd8U8gSC-YzZy65mjZpsxcVi4QJmYuECZk\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2026世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉（IG@kouitakura）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896899465613312589470.jpeg/VqvWTP4b_BOV6PjDUL5WiqQmk_GZFqZeEcEWWxHBFls\"/><figcaption>2026世界盃足球賽日本隊隊長板倉滉（IG@kouitakura）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896294089265152587036.jpeg/kG0Mm1RSUAT0SMyRCdN_Vxut8T5QVEFyMIhTzjCIU84\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896293501931520867213.jpeg/xVVCtihNWBQr4fxpEEUYn44PjkiynC1Vto_S0baP0tE\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896301995921408162384.jpeg/f-crdABfLw7fsM9VpH0pQAMI1KS59yaFSPE2bkjxNm4\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896302809616384289157.jpeg/CFo3aCKpadsNQlUXMHSOseAuQjauRQZZfEjHZHxIx2Q\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896296035422208180239.jpeg/dUM4zpumCI6BX_F9b41gElPTxyyTrbCOl2y3XJdst1w\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896298254340096265719.jpeg/DDSisWcwpZh-j9C1XfMTZGOj7lW6QnBbqwt_pasLf6U\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896300682973184965428.jpeg/w8LjpB4sE0oH9Nm59qWPsfy1jAtq-IuHb0rjOG9K4zg\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896295397888000164235.jpeg/MM3QpZqA6sbnlDQ1s5MqMjMl30wfQaDfjjIowY4yKME\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896297792966656284637.jpeg/cpE1uL0nYzwEriwkgdw0xWp3iQ5oVv3Foy0DKaMtAyk\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896299957358592865091.jpeg/N6Jj6NnmlW4Un4OOiXsSA7gENtenyIXLc-UEQXPlBEE\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896300934762496047168.jpeg/d9-AcX3WtWWpuS_nTQqzDyPun0mUcIZee3oZMnt6GTI\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896298585821184850394.jpeg/FDwoFa1aLyvz2xG_lq8uxkPSveaU5J1YatjEv2rYxL8\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896291937456128159743.jpeg/R-Y28zb4CFO_hxdkPe8t0JKqJ5r8II3QFjRJORY0STk\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160896296245268480284370.jpeg/8e3f03_jqvv44JrAYUmcIshVsLKJlU6sOdjgDznY4A8\"/><figcaption>川口春奈（IG@haruna_kawaguchi_official）</figcaption></figure><p>談及未來生活，川口春奈表示，希望寶寶能夠平安出生，也期待能與另一半平靜、安穩地度過每一天。她更甜蜜寫道，未來將會彼此扶持，打造一個充滿笑容、幸福美滿的家庭，字句間洋溢著對婚姻與新生命的期待。最後也向一路以來支持她的粉絲喊話，希望大家未來能繼續給予關心與支持。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】《藍色生死戀》文根英宣佈結婚喜訊　低調嫁大7歲音樂劇男演員（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】《藍色生死戀》文根英宣佈結婚喜訊　低調嫁大7歲音樂劇男演員（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077993428553728841376.jpeg/hPo1QD-DoWoIR1NLj-nbdEE-QXcjnr5Xv0ygyr9MoMo\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】《藍色生死戀》文根英宣佈結婚喜訊　低調嫁大7歲音樂劇男演員（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國女星文瑾瑩（曾用名：文根英），29日透過社群公開一封親筆信，親自向粉絲宣佈結婚喜訊。（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077547296690176195342.jpeg/47Ygw4_L2OqgMEFqRuRa7sSllwDZ7Ji-0xtA3tMbQN4\"/><figcaption>韓國女星文瑾瑩（曾用名：文根英），29日透過社群公開一封親筆信，親自向粉絲宣佈結婚喜訊。（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩透過社群公開一封親筆信宣佈結婚喜訊。（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077982900326400986504.jpeg/Lv5yjgFNVXzRJoU9pJD6dYVOk6wxpJiNnwV_uJ8Ff7g\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩透過社群公開一封親筆信宣佈結婚喜訊。（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（右）嫁大7歲音樂劇男演員鄭平（左）。（NAVER）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159087795642306560783206.jpeg/l-97e3ytUiWfcLSbm7ZoZCEbCfO_azpkMu2JfzLtiX8\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（右）嫁大7歲音樂劇男演員鄭平（左）。（NAVER）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩於12歲出道，2000年憑在《藍色生死戀》中飾演童年版宋慧喬廣為人知，成為國民妹妹。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3440348/org/a21ae04d95733e8195fdfd3e9d36e91d.jpg/FtbnsBiO2I-ALlY9pONZVjYDGyaz7GQQptTq9KbU6vQ\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩於12歲出道，2000年憑在《藍色生死戀》中飾演童年版宋慧喬廣為人知，成為國民妹妹。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩於2000年飾演《藍色生死戀》童年版宋慧喬。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159081822274064384802716.jpeg/Zbpk5J1OY_N_6smryWqr0vz2WpWFIWIbsXxqD7F8ag8\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩於2000年飾演《藍色生死戀》童年版宋慧喬。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩《藍色生死戀》中哭戲動人。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159081824383930368583174.jpeg/v61PGhbdNm3bj8lQ0Q_FijJTOijFYznhefnJ93n5yfc\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩《藍色生死戀》中哭戲動人。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩於2000年飾演《藍色生死戀》童年版宋慧喬。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159081820013203456936705.jpeg/_RtVkNVMHsEpcRAcZfijZGg7xMBA93fY4ePEGOHjxBg\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩於2000年飾演《藍色生死戀》童年版宋慧喬。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩於2000年飾演《藍色生死戀》童年版宋慧喬。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1771028/org/ae1c54ead52102bae56acd764bb607a3.jpg/WlGthc023PlWOUCQszSC4YaLGw5msggRQD50qEA-dKg\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩於2000年飾演《藍色生死戀》童年版宋慧喬。（《藍色生死戀》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20141009/14128553915436765fe7ed7.jpg/Ar8kgNVC_krr4M8cSq_HDecVdtMcRnpo8UYsffFGLH0\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩、金汎（《火之女神井兒》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210408/456817915426115584842503.jpeg/jEypprdNVzFDeCdU2oUYP3j56s_plNBRsAH-f7AB_n8\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩、金汎（《火之女神井兒》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077991012503552960147.jpeg/6U2gU62_exjELVE4cHf9oNU-o8ASp35o-5A1-_uQNfs\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077983093264384342610.jpeg/B2tpqyByQ4kZhHXy4J6f7nkvtKJbWAqXQOwDc0DsA3M\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077987598209024247315.jpeg/nmfEZETAFhZDIFKMN3Bm9tdJG7213Upnq1sUK6tbFCs\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077985370902528572809.jpeg/je8-lJhbj9OLMa2xdZkWrQGHFRw33sxX6Puyoej7sqE\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077987690483712267910.jpeg/uh_e7H8uKeh0uxlT-4nPvBKlVBcmzM_n8bO3SfGzt0k\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159077985307987968714528.jpeg/SMjPq0m7hTffGOrt4aGHKHs99UOVYvqTsbSQx7G0kMc\"/><figcaption>文瑾瑩（IG@aka_moons）</figcaption></figure><p>「廣告女王」川口春奈秘戀足球國腳1年　9千公里遠距戀愛修成正果</p><p>李多慧砸85萬買新車！公開車牌號碼藏玄機　鐵粉笑曝其用意</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T03:38:43.502968+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1694,"images":35,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}